# Chance-Met Elves: "Whenever you scry, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. This ability triggers only once each
# turn." Bot1 casts the Elves on turn 1 (Mox Sapphire for Sol Ring, Sol Ring and Mox Emerald for the Elves). On turn 3
# Bot1 casts two Preordains, each scrying 2 (CR 701.22): the first scry triggers the Elves, the second does not (it
# triggers only once each turn), so the Elves have one counter. On turn 5 a third Preordain's scry triggers it again,
# a new turn: two counters, a 5/4.

